    },
    "Most tools draw a rectangle over the text and leave the words underneath — copy-paste or a text dump reveals them, which has caused real disclosure leaks. Here, any page with a match is rebuilt as an image with no text layer, so the words are gone. Pages with nothing to redact keep their selectable text. The output is then searched again for every term, and if even one survives, no file is produced." : {

